          "text": "Cough and associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Dry cough for 7/7; began with a sore throat, now resolved. Mild coryza and intermittent headache. Sleep disrupted by cough, especially at night."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Respiratory and systemic symptom review"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies shortness of breath, chest pain, wheeze, fever, haemoptysis, weight loss, night sweats, and TB contact."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Vulval lump"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports a left vulval lump for 4–5/7, increasing in size and painful with walking and sitting; described as “like a marble in there.”"
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Associated vulval and genitourinary symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No discharge or “pimple head” reported. Denies dysuria, frequency, vaginal discharge, itch, and odour."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
